/*
 * imageres.dll: icons by the numbers Windows gives them
 *
 * Windows keeps most of the system's icons in imageres.dll, and what is
 * registered names them by number ("imageres.dll,-114" is Administrative
 * Tools): Arctic's have the same numbers. Arctic's own pictures, put
 * together by tools/cpl-icons.py from ICONS/ and the Longhorn theme; 9001
 * and up are numbers Windows does not use here.
 *
